OL,3,GNEWSAThe friendship groups helping
OL,4,Awomen take the 'admin' out of
OL,5,Asocialising
OL,6,
OL,7,F"I'm a very independent person, but I
OL,8,Ffound I was missing a community," says
OL,9,F22-year-old Fiona Kwan of the moment
OL,10,Fshe realised she was feeling lonely.
OL,12,FWhile on clinical placement, the
OL,13,FUniversity of Sheffield medical student
OL,14,Fsays she got into a "rinse and repeat"
OL,15,Fweekly routine, with little time for
OL,16,Fsocialising.
OL,18,F"It's really hard to build those kind
OL,19,Fof relationships, especially in the
OL,20,Fworkplace because you want to keep it
OL,21,Fstrictly professional," she says.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
